==Battleground==
*2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (100%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While harder than the [[Kids At School|previous stage]] by a small margin, I Am A Cat can still be beaten using simple [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] spam if you have a decent amount of [[Treasure]].

==Trivia==
*This stage is named after Natsume Sōseki's famous novel [[wikipedia:I Am a Cat|''I Am a Cat'']]. The personal pronoun employed in the title is deemed pompous and almost exclusively used in 'cat speech' in the modern era.
**This stage is also called the same in the Japanese version, but it is more formalized into "I am a cat."

